cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HeapLeach in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: HeapLeach
abstract: >-
  HeapLeach is a bulk downloader in one static binary. It resolves the
  albums, folders and playlists behind links from 180+ sites — file hosts,
  image galleries, video and broadcaster pages — and downloads the files in
  parallel, with resumable multi-connection transfers, a per-host throttle
  for overloaded servers, and native decryption of MEGA files and AES-128
  HLS streams. A React web UI is compiled into the Go binary, which also
  downloads headless in a terminal.
authors:
  - given-names: Johan
    family-names: Lindvall
repository-code: "https://github.com/JohanLindvall/HeapLeach"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - bulk downloader
  - download manager
  - file hosts
  - resumable downloads
  - HLS
  - Go
  - React
